{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the volcanic eruption, the climate has become abnormal. Floodwaters are about to inundate our homes. Commander, please lead the people to quickly build an ark and save them! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total Game Duration Is Approximately 15 Minutes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a simple building game where you just need to click the mouse and consume resources to advance the shipbuilding process in order to achieve victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchasing this game will grant you approximately 15 minutes of simple shipbuilding experience, with multiple playthrough content (note that the multiple playthrough content has not been rigorously tested, so the gaming experience cannot be guaranteed), and you'll also unlock 2 fun Steam achievements!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer's Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game idea came to me one afternoon, and I spent quite a bit of time designing and coding it. Although the game may not be perfect, and it has many flaws and lacks sufficient polishing time, it is still a complete game. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Best Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998610/ebf82c3aa9e3b1756353b082f7587e27e7d3ed05.jpg"},{"name":"RunAway","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2998610/475dd91d9e2d84ac17bc1d85faa7378095ec3530.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2998610?t=1749365989","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2998610?t=1749365989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998610/18868e78ba5b194eb65e7a0697fca9d69e8355e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749365989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998610/18868e78ba5b194eb65e7a0697fca9d69e8355e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749365989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>The bullet screen function is unavailable.</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the server being attacked by a third party, I have disabled the chat function (this is the only online feature). This will not affect the gameplay. It's just that the bullet screen function in the lower right corner will be unavailable.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to the volcanic eruption, the climate has become abnormal. Floodwaters are about to inundate our homes. Commander, please lead the people to quickly build an ark and save them! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total Game Duration Is Approximately 15 Minutes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a simple building game where you just need to click the mouse and consume resources to advance the shipbuilding process in order to achieve victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchasing this game will grant you approximately 15 minutes of simple shipbuilding experience, with multiple playthrough content (note that the multiple playthrough content has not been rigorously tested, so the gaming experience cannot be guaranteed), and you'll also unlock 2 fun Steam achievements!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer's Note</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game idea came to me one afternoon, and I spent quite a bit of time designing and coding it. Although the game may not be perfect, and it has many flaws and lacks sufficient polishing time, it is still a complete game. </p>","developers":["\u840c\u65b0\u6240\u957f"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998610/8fc03c2e82c2543afebfd49505312aee138249d7/header.jpg?t=1749365989","is_free":fa